    "A merge_databases Decision, exactly in the shape `database-tools.ts` files",
    "it: three sources moved into the target, each with its row count, row",
    "fingerprint and column signature (`{id,name,type}` — a signature names a",
    "column, it does not carry its select options), the columns the merge adds",
    "(`DatabaseColumnSpec`s, so a new select keeps its options), the target select",
    "column whose options widen, the target schema at propose time (the staleness",
    "guard), the dedupe flag, and one sha256 over the sorted source fingerprints.",
    "All four tables share the reported duplicate name (\"Supplement log\"), which",
    "is the drift the op exists to collapse — the card keys each source row by",
    "database id and labels it with the source's name.",
    "Ids and fingerprints are neutral stand-ins; the shape is not."
